1
00:00:03,220 --> 00:00:07,250
♪By red walls and a dry well,
my crown gathers dust and frost♪

2
00:00:07,640 --> 00:00:11,860
♪With a hoe and a patch of wasteland,
I sow the moonlight♪

3
00:00:11,900 --> 00:00:16,120
♪Who says the Cold Palace
holds nothing but tears?♪

4
00:00:16,310 --> 00:00:20,330
♪I choose to fill it with fragrant wine♪

5
00:00:20,670 --> 00:00:22,200
♪Farming in the Cold Palace♪

6
00:00:22,250 --> 00:00:24,730
♪Growing life's simple joys♪

7
00:00:24,800 --> 00:00:26,880
♪Bins full of grain, jars full of wine♪

8
00:00:26,970 --> 00:00:28,760
♪Better than dancing in silks♪

9
00:00:29,420 --> 00:00:30,650
♪Farming in the Cold Palace♪

10
00:00:30,930 --> 00:00:33,320
♪My heart longs for the world beyond♪

11
00:00:33,690 --> 00:00:35,800
♪Tending a courtyard full of life♪

12
00:00:36,140 --> 00:00:40,560
♪Come, share a cup with me♪

13
00:00:40,570 --> 00:00:42,540
(Welcome to Cold Palace Refreshments)

14
00:00:45,720 --> 00:00:47,040
=Farm Busily in the Cold Palace=

15
00:00:47,040 --> 00:00:48,620
(Based on Hongshu.com's novel
I'm Busy Farming in the Cold Palace)

16
00:00:48,620 --> 00:00:49,650
=Episode 23=

17
00:00:59,679 --> 00:01:00,759
Let's see who dares!

18
00:01:01,679 --> 00:01:02,439
Ah!

19
00:01:04,280 --> 00:01:07,920
Spare me, Your Highness!

20
00:01:07,920 --> 00:01:09,079
Take this scoundrel away

21
00:01:09,719 --> 00:01:10,879
and interrogate him!

22
00:01:11,280 --> 00:01:12,040
Ah!

23
00:01:12,840 --> 00:01:13,840
I was wrong!

24
00:01:13,840 --> 00:01:15,560
Your Highness, spare my life!

25
00:01:15,799 --> 00:01:18,000
I was acting on someone's orders!

26
00:01:18,480 --> 00:01:19,239
Ah!

27
00:01:29,120 --> 00:01:30,239
I got careless.

28
00:01:30,239 --> 00:01:33,120
With him dead, the trail has gone cold.

29
00:01:36,079 --> 00:01:38,439
The culprit will slip up eventually.

30
00:01:38,840 --> 00:01:39,640
Save them first.

31
00:01:39,959 --> 00:01:41,519
Confirmed cases, register on the left.

32
00:01:41,519 --> 00:01:43,120
Suspected cases, take a number on the
right.

33
00:01:47,239 --> 00:01:47,840
Sir,

34
00:01:47,840 --> 00:01:48,959
once we're inoculated,

35
00:01:48,959 --> 00:01:50,400
we really won't catch the disease?

36
00:01:50,519 --> 00:01:51,519
An 80 to 90% chance.

37
00:01:52,280 --> 00:01:53,640
Even Prince Chen had it done.

38
00:01:53,760 --> 00:01:55,159
What are you afraid of?

39
00:01:55,840 --> 00:01:58,200
He may not fear death, but I do!

40
00:02:03,200 --> 00:02:06,439
(The Empress Dowager called the Empress
a demonic star incarnate.)

41
00:02:06,799 --> 00:02:08,919
(Yet her virtue lights up the city.)

42
00:02:09,159 --> 00:02:12,240
(The Emperor Star surely protects her.)

43
00:02:13,560 --> 00:02:15,800
Your Highness's virtue is boundless.

44
00:02:16,400 --> 00:02:17,960
You deserve a place in the Ancestral
Temple.

45
00:02:18,400 --> 00:02:19,800
When I return,

46
00:02:19,879 --> 00:02:22,639
I'll petition the throne to honor you.

47
00:02:24,039 --> 00:02:25,039
No Ancestral Temple for me.

48
00:02:25,319 --> 00:02:26,039
Well.

49
00:02:26,039 --> 00:02:28,000
Why not tell my fortune instead?

50
00:02:28,159 --> 00:02:29,159
Will I be rich?

51
00:02:35,800 --> 00:02:36,680
Oh!

52
00:02:38,159 --> 00:02:39,039
Remarkable!

53
00:02:39,879 --> 00:02:41,199
Your Highness,

54
00:02:41,199 --> 00:02:44,800
your chart foretells great wealth.

55
00:02:45,159 --> 00:02:46,319
Within three years,

56
00:02:46,840 --> 00:02:49,199
you'll be the richest person alive.

57
00:02:49,960 --> 00:02:51,039
Really?

58
00:02:52,919 --> 00:02:53,960
Great!

59
00:02:53,960 --> 00:02:55,319
May your words come true!

60
00:02:56,199 --> 00:02:56,919
Yinshuang,

61
00:02:58,240 --> 00:02:59,680
let's go check on Prince Chen.

62
00:03:00,000 --> 00:03:00,360
Yes.

63
00:03:00,360 --> 00:03:02,199
Tailing County is stable now.

64
00:03:02,520 --> 00:03:03,719
Once everyone is inoculated,

65
00:03:04,120 --> 00:03:05,319
we can be on our way.

66
00:03:05,479 --> 00:03:05,840
Yes.

67
00:03:05,840 --> 00:03:06,360
Let's go.

68
00:03:10,240 --> 00:03:10,599
Ah!

69
00:03:12,940 --> 00:03:16,240
(Helian Yu)

70
00:03:16,759 --> 00:03:18,520
Spare me, my lord!

71
00:03:18,520 --> 00:03:19,159
I...

72
00:03:20,080 --> 00:03:20,719
Hmph.

73
00:03:21,400 --> 00:03:23,039
Spare you?

74
00:03:23,159 --> 00:03:24,240
Useless fool.

75
00:03:24,240 --> 00:03:25,960
You couldn't handle one simple task.

76
00:03:26,719 --> 00:03:28,120
I had to do it myself.

77
00:03:35,159 --> 00:03:35,960
Calm down, my lord.

78
00:03:36,479 --> 00:03:38,400
Donglan's empress is extremely capable.

79
00:03:38,960 --> 00:03:41,479
The city worships her as a goddess.

80
00:03:41,879 --> 00:03:43,360
If we act rashly...

81
00:03:43,759 --> 00:03:44,840
A goddess?

82
00:03:45,719 --> 00:03:49,280
Ha-ha-ha!

83
00:03:49,719 --> 00:03:50,719
Excellent.

84
00:03:51,240 --> 00:03:53,039
Now I want to cut her open

85
00:03:53,680 --> 00:03:55,719
and see how she differs from mortals.

86
00:03:55,719 --> 00:03:56,960
But His Majesty has forbidden it.

87
00:03:56,960 --> 00:03:58,879
Beicang cannot fight Donglan now.

88
00:03:59,250 --> 00:04:00,240
(A Shattered Realm)

89
00:04:00,240 --> 00:04:02,400
Who says Beicang sent me?

90
00:04:02,960 --> 00:04:04,840
Let Liu take the blame.

91
00:04:05,520 --> 00:04:06,919
Wouldn't that be more fun?

92
00:04:11,080 --> 00:04:12,000
Stop!

93
00:04:12,000 --> 00:04:13,000
Tailing County is sealed off.

94
00:04:13,120 --> 00:04:14,719
Trespassers will be killed on sight.

95
00:04:14,719 --> 00:04:15,879
(A Shattered Realm)

96
00:04:15,879 --> 00:04:16,600
Ha.

97
00:04:24,720 --> 00:04:26,519
Killed on sight?

98
00:04:27,199 --> 00:04:29,000
Then why are you still standing?

99
00:04:31,680 --> 00:04:32,480
You...

100
00:04:32,480 --> 00:04:33,600
Who are you?

101
00:04:36,000 --> 00:04:37,639
Listen well.

102
00:04:37,639 --> 00:04:39,519
Tell the King of Hell my name.

103
00:04:40,000 --> 00:04:42,720
Helian Yu of Beicang.

104
00:04:44,720 --> 00:04:46,080
(Mingyun Pavilion)

105
00:04:50,720 --> 00:04:52,279
You look better today, Uncle.

106
00:04:53,279 --> 00:04:55,120
Still tight-chested and short of breath?

107
00:04:58,680 --> 00:04:59,519
I'm fine now.

108
00:05:03,319 --> 00:05:06,319
Why keep the Blacksteel Guard idle here?

109
00:05:06,399 --> 00:05:07,360
I can't stay here.

110
00:05:07,360 --> 00:05:09,040
The people of Tailing County need me.

111
00:05:09,920 --> 00:05:11,399
The epidemic is under control.

112
00:05:11,959 --> 00:05:13,399
The Chief Imperial Physician is here.

113
00:05:13,759 --> 00:05:14,839
Just focus on recovering.

114
00:05:17,199 --> 00:05:18,000
That's good.

115
00:05:19,199 --> 00:05:20,360
This body of mine

116
00:05:20,759 --> 00:05:22,360
may have survived smallpox,

117
00:05:22,720 --> 00:05:24,120
but it left me terribly weak.

118
00:05:24,720 --> 00:05:27,600
I don't have many years left.

119
00:05:29,079 --> 00:05:31,000
I want to do what I can.

120
00:05:32,560 --> 00:05:33,680
I checked the medical texts.

121
00:05:34,120 --> 00:05:36,079
You have post-smallpox wasting.

122
00:05:38,240 --> 00:05:41,560
Ginseng restores vitality; lilyturf
moistens the lungs and restores fluids.

123
00:05:41,720 --> 00:05:43,879
Schisandra gathers energy to the heart.

124
00:05:44,040 --> 00:05:45,519
With Four Gentlemen Decoction,

125
00:05:45,759 --> 00:05:47,480
you'll recover in three months.

126
00:05:48,879 --> 00:05:49,680
You...

127
00:05:50,399 --> 00:05:52,560
When did you learn so much medicine?

128
00:06:02,759 --> 00:06:03,560
The truth is,

129
00:06:05,120 --> 00:06:07,120
I'm not the Lu Yunluo you once knew.

130
00:06:10,680 --> 00:06:11,759
Inside this body

131
00:06:12,560 --> 00:06:13,800
is a soul from another world.

132
00:06:21,560 --> 00:06:22,480
No wonder...

133
00:06:24,720 --> 00:06:26,079
No wonder you forgot everything.

134
00:06:29,000 --> 00:06:33,399
Let the past fade like morning dew.

135
00:06:36,680 --> 00:06:37,480
Take care.

136
00:07:02,079 --> 00:07:03,079
- Goddess!!
- Goddess!!

137
00:07:03,079 --> 00:07:04,079
Freshly baked flatbreads!

138
00:07:04,079 --> 00:07:04,959
Try one.

139
00:07:14,759 --> 00:07:15,560
Delicious!

140
00:07:15,879 --> 00:07:16,639
Your Highness,

141
00:07:16,639 --> 00:07:17,759
my sweet osmanthus cakes!

142
00:07:17,759 --> 00:07:19,079
You must try them!

143
00:07:19,319 --> 00:07:20,199
All right.

144
00:07:20,199 --> 00:07:21,199
I'll try them all.

145
00:07:21,199 --> 00:07:21,839
Yinshuang.

146
00:07:24,879 --> 00:07:25,800
No, no, no!

147
00:07:25,800 --> 00:07:26,720
Keep your money.

148
00:07:26,800 --> 00:07:29,240
You saved all of Tailing County!

149
00:07:32,600 --> 00:07:33,399
My lady,

150
00:07:33,560 --> 00:07:36,519
do they see you as a living saint?

151
00:07:37,839 --> 00:07:39,480
Being a saint isn't easy.

152
00:07:44,319 --> 00:07:45,240
The horses are ready.

153
00:07:46,000 --> 00:07:47,040
Everything is ready.

154
00:07:48,199 --> 00:07:49,279
We'll slip away tonight.

155
00:07:49,279 --> 00:07:49,720
Yes.

156
00:07:54,040 --> 00:07:55,800
Donglan's empress

157
00:07:58,399 --> 00:07:59,879
is quite interesting.

158
00:08:01,399 --> 00:08:02,560
(A Shattered Realm)
A shame

159
00:08:03,759 --> 00:08:05,920
beauty dies so young.

160
00:08:07,920 --> 00:08:09,839
Goddess!

161
00:08:10,199 --> 00:08:11,160
Flowers!

162
00:08:11,160 --> 00:08:14,319
I just picked them.

163
00:08:14,319 --> 00:08:15,759
They're for you.

164
00:08:23,000 --> 00:08:24,279
Thank you.

165
00:08:24,279 --> 00:08:25,600
Call her "Your Highness."

166
00:08:26,439 --> 00:08:28,439
It's fine. Just call me "Sister."

167
00:08:28,439 --> 00:08:30,079
"Sister" makes me sound young.

168
00:08:48,039 --> 00:08:48,840
My lady!

169
00:08:50,159 --> 00:08:53,679
Your Highness!

170
00:08:53,679 --> 00:08:54,919
Your Highness!

171
00:08:55,360 --> 00:08:58,000
Sister, don't fall asleep!

172
00:08:58,519 --> 00:09:02,039
I have so many more flowers for you!

173
00:09:02,039 --> 00:09:02,840
Sister!

174
00:09:08,000 --> 00:09:08,799
Hmph.

175
00:09:12,639 --> 00:09:16,240
Donglan will enter national mourning.

176
00:09:17,679 --> 00:09:19,159
My lord, everything is ready.

177
00:09:19,159 --> 00:09:20,159
Ready to strike.

178
00:09:21,240 --> 00:09:22,919
That assassin wasn't you?

179
00:09:23,399 --> 00:09:24,240
No, my lord.

180
00:09:27,279 --> 00:09:28,799
(Her Highness is dead!)

181
00:09:28,960 --> 00:09:30,159
(Terrible news!)

182
00:09:30,159 --> 00:09:31,919
(Her Highness is dead!)

183
00:09:36,240 --> 00:09:37,039
Investigate.

184
00:09:37,759 --> 00:09:39,159
Examine her body at once.

185
00:09:39,960 --> 00:09:40,759
Yes, my lord.

186
00:09:51,039 --> 00:09:53,159
Brother, how did it go?

187
00:09:56,480 --> 00:09:57,519
It's done.

188
00:09:58,000 --> 00:10:01,519
Her Highness's fake-death escape was
brilliant.

189
00:10:02,600 --> 00:10:03,399
But

190
00:10:04,080 --> 00:10:05,639
the Chief Imperial Physician is here.

191
00:10:06,159 --> 00:10:07,600
What if

192
00:10:07,600 --> 00:10:09,519
he finds out she's faking her death?

193
00:10:09,960 --> 00:10:11,200
Don't worry.

194
00:10:11,200 --> 00:10:13,360
If she says it'll work, it'll work.

195
00:10:35,760 --> 00:10:39,790
♪By red walls and a dry well,
my crown gathers dust and frost♪

196
00:10:40,180 --> 00:10:44,400
♪With a hoe and a patch of wasteland,
I sow the moonlight♪

197
00:10:44,440 --> 00:10:48,620
♪Who says the Cold Palace
holds nothing but tears?♪

198
00:10:48,680 --> 00:10:52,870
♪I choose to fill it with fragrant wine♪

199
00:10:53,210 --> 00:10:57,270
♪Cool dew, starry nights,
wheat sprouts in my hands♪

200
00:10:57,340 --> 00:11:01,520
♪I shape fields, not painted brows,
and fill them with hope♪

201
00:11:01,960 --> 00:11:05,330
♪Gold and silver bloom from the soil♪

202
00:11:05,800 --> 00:11:10,480
♪I smile as the world storms on♪

203
00:11:12,140 --> 00:11:14,290
♪No finery to rival spring♪

204
00:11:14,470 --> 00:11:18,770
♪All I wish for are waves of green♪

205
00:11:21,180 --> 00:11:22,930
♪Where is beauty found?♪

206
00:11:23,110 --> 00:11:27,540
♪Just lift your eyes and see♪

207
00:11:28,100 --> 00:11:29,670
♪Farming in the Cold Palace♪

208
00:11:29,690 --> 00:11:32,160
♪Growing life's simple joys♪

209
00:11:32,230 --> 00:11:34,310
♪Bins full of grain, jars full of wine♪

210
00:11:34,470 --> 00:11:36,240
♪Better than dancing in silks♪

211
00:11:36,850 --> 00:11:38,120
♪Farming in the Cold Palace♪

212
00:11:38,350 --> 00:11:40,750
♪My heart longs for the world beyond♪

213
00:11:40,990 --> 00:11:43,290
♪Tending a courtyard full of life♪

214
00:11:43,570 --> 00:11:47,890
♪Come, share a cup with me♪
